# Store every file exactly as it is on disk: no line-ending conversion, on
# any machine, whatever that machine's core.autocrlf says. This codebase
# mixes CRLF and LF files, and letting git normalise them would show every
# CRLF file as modified for anyone whose settings differ from the committer's.
# Diffs still work — this only switches off end-of-line rewriting.
* -text
